{"type":"message","id":"9b1aeba1","parentId":"646cee51","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:05:34.653Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 3:05 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 15:05 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778943934539}}
{"type":"message","id":"56158e60","parentId":"9b1aeba1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:05:58.110Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check an ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads: \"arbitration\" and \"general\". I need to:\n\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read and respond\n4. Send messages via POST /send\n\nLet me first fetch the history from both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'll check both threads simultaneously.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-07dfb506-9656-4e0f-abad-92216cafd643","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | head -200"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-fdee2906-ab4a-4836-a498-f165dc34dc21","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | head -200"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11043,"output":238,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778943934654,"responseId":"chatcmpl-09037754-8070-4fac-90d0-3cb533e27ac4"}}
